{
  "slug": "deepmiro",
  "name": "Deepmiro",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Predict how people and communities will react to events, policies, announcements, or documents — before they happen. DeepMiro creates hundreds of AI personas (journalists, critics, supporters, officials, regulators) and lets them debate your scenario on simulated Twitter and Reddit platforms. You get back a structured prediction report, can interview any persona about their reasoning, and upload documents (PDFs, reports, regulations) to ground predictions.\nDeepMiro runs a full prediction in 7 minutes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `predict` (Run a DeepMiro swarm prediction — simulate how hundreds of AI agents with distinct personas would react to…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `UserPromptSubmit`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `deepmiro`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install deepmiro@claude-community` from `kakarot-dev/deepmiro`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
